# SCULPT-ONE: one Sculpt tool in the Deform palette (Vertex Sculpt gone); its Move brush drags a bump on the
# active plane through the first hit; one Undo returns the sphere
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.53,0.6
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Sculpt "Sculpt tool"
Тогда 0_palette the Deform palette shows ONE Sculpt entry and no "Vertex Sculpt" / "VSculpt" button
Когда run Sculpt "Brush: Move"
Когда --subject viewport drag 700,330 820,250 20
Тогда-вид 1_move the sphere carries a bump pulled out toward the upper right, along the view-facing plane
Когда run Action "Undo"
Тогда-вид 2_undo the sphere is smooth again, as before the drag
